  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 20630724608
    m_Localized: '<color=green>Objective:</color>

      Guide the ball to the finish
      points in different mazes as fast as possible. Collect as many stars as you
      can. Complete all the levels to beat the game.



      <sprite index=5> <sprite
      index=0> Use the <color=green>LEFT/RIGHT ARROW KEYS</color>

      <sprite
      index=8> <sprite index=8><sprite index=8> to rotate the maze.


      Press
      <color=yellow>R</color> to restart the level.


      The <color=green>FINISH
      POINTS</color> will initially be locked. You''ll need to collect the <color=yellow>yellow
      key</color> to unlock them.


      <sprite index=1> Collect the <color=yellow>YELLOW
      STARS</color> scattered

      <sprite index=8> around the maze.


      <sprite
      index=2> Avoid the <color=red>RED STARS</color> as collecting one

      <sprite
      index=8> will make you lose one star.

      <sprite index=8> If you collect
      them without any stars,

      <sprite index=8> the level fails.


      <sprite
      index=3> <color=#15C4FF>TELEPORT POINTS</color> will teleport the ball.

      <sprite
      index=8> (Duh!)



      <sprite index=4> However, some of them may be locked.
      Find <color=#15C4FF>

      <sprite index=8> their keys</color> with their
      corresponding colors

      <sprite index=8> to unlock them.


      <sprite
      index=6> Also watch out for the <color=red>PITFALLS</color>

      <sprite
      index=8> as dropping the ball out of the maze

      <sprite index=8> will
      fail the level.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8044773038083014681
  - m_Id: 536098103296
    m_Localized: '<color=green>Objective:</color>

      Guide the ball to the finish
      points in different mazes as fast as possible. Collect as many stars as you
      can. Complete all the levels to beat the game.



      <sprite index=7> <sprite
      index=0> Tap the <color=green>LEFT/RIGHT SIDES</color>

      <sprite index=8>
      <sprite index=8><sprite index=8> of the screen to rotate the maze.


      The
      <color=green>FINISH POINTS</color> will initially be locked. You''ll need to
      collect the <color=yellow>yellow key</color> to unlock them.


      <sprite
      index=1> Collect the <color=yellow>YELLOW STARS</color> scattered

      <sprite
      index=8> around the maze.


      <sprite index=2> Avoid the <color=red>RED
      STARS</color> as collecting one

      <sprite index=8> will make you lose
      one star.

      <sprite index=8> If you collect them without any stars,

      <sprite
      index=8> the level fails.


      <sprite index=3> <color=#15C4FF>TELEPORT
      POINTS</color> will teleport the ball.

      <sprite index=8> (Duh!)



      <sprite
      index=4> However, some of them may be locked. Find <color=#15C4FF>

      <sprite
      index=8> their keys</color> with their corresponding colors

      <sprite
      index=8> to unlock them.


      <sprite index=6> Also watch out for the <color=red>PITFALLS</color>

      <sprite
      index=8> as dropping the ball out of the maze

      <sprite index=8> will
      fail the level.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15627476525056
    m_Localized: 'Level 1

      Use <color=yellow>Arrow Keys</color> to move

      Press
      <color=yellow>R</color> to restart the level'
